      "source_text": "Decide with a reason, and compute where possible: (a) $\\min_{x\\ge0}e^{-x}$; (b) $\\min_{x\\in[0,1]}(x^2-x)$; (c) $\\min\\|u\\|^2$ subject to $u_1+u_2\\ge1$ in $\\mathbb R^2$; (d) $\\max_{u\\in\\mathbb R^2}(u_1+u_2)$; (e) for which $c$ is $\\{x\\in\\mathbb R:x^2/(1+x^2)\\le c\\}$ compact?",
